<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":< rust_operators\n:< sm'_operators\n\n:! timestamp_gleam =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () => global \"import gleam/time/timestamp\") : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'timestamp.Timestamp'\n    )\n:! timestamp = i64\n\n:= timestamp \\* t {int}. (x : t) : timestamp =\n    timestamp (convert::convert x : i64)\n\n:= timestamp_gleam_of ((timestamp x) : timestamp) : timestamp_gleam =\n    global \"import gleam/time/timestamp\"\n    := seconds = x / 1000000i64\n    := nanos = (x % 1000000i64) * 1000i64\n    $'timestamp.from_unix_seconds_and_nanoseconds(!seconds, !nanos)'\n\n:== timestamp_guid = guid::guid\n\n:== date_time_guid = guid::guid","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :< rust_operators
  :< sm'_operators

  :! timestamp_gleam =
      `(
          backend_switch `(()) `({}) {
              Gleam = (\ () => global "import gleam/time/timestamp") : () -> ()
          }
          $'' : $'timestamp.Timestamp'
      )
  :! timestamp = i64

  := timestamp \* t {int}. (x : t) : timestamp =
      timestamp (convert::convert x : i64)

  := timestamp_gleam_of ((timestamp x) : timestamp) : timestamp_gleam =
      global "import gleam/time/timestamp"
      := seconds = x / 1000000i64
      := nanos = (x % 1000000i64) * 1000i64
      $'timestamp.from_unix_seconds_and_nanoseconds(!seconds, !nanos)'

  :== timestamp_guid = guid::guid

  :== date_time_guid = guid::guid
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

