<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":| day_of_week =\n    | Sunday\n    | Monday\n    | Tuesday\n    | Wednesday\n    | Thursday\n    | Friday\n    | Saturday\n\n:| month =\n    | January\n    | February\n    | March\n    | April\n    | May\n    | June\n    | July\n    | August\n    | September\n    | October\n    | November\n    | December\n\n:! day = int\n\n:! year = int\n\n:! date_gleam =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () =>\n                global \"import gleam/time/calendar\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'calendar.Date'\n    )\n:! time_of_day_gleam =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () =>\n                global \"import gleam/time/calendar\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'calendar.TimeOfDay'\n    )\n:! duration_gleam =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () =>\n                global \"import gleam/time/duration\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'duration.Duration'\n    )\n\n:! date_time_python =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Python = (\\ () => global \"import datetime\") : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'datetime.datetime'\n    )\n:== date_time_switch =\n    {\n        Gleam : date_gleam * time_of_day_gleam * duration_gleam\n        Lua : i64\n        Fsharp : $'System.DateTime'\n        Python : date_time_python\n        Rust : $'chrono::NaiveDateTime'\n        TypeScript : $'Date'\n        Zig : i64\n    }\n:! date_time = $'backend_switch `(date_time_switch)'\n\n:! calendar_month =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () =>\n                global \"import gleam/time/calendar\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'calendar.Month'\n    )\n\n:! tempo_date_time =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () =>\n                global \"import tempo\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'tempo.DateTime'\n    )\n\n:= zig_micros_of (date_time : date_time) : i64 = $'!date_time' : i64\n\n:= zig_date_time_of (micros : i64) : date_time = $'!micros' : date_time\n\n:= zig_micros_windows_global () : () =\n    global \"\"\"\n        fn spiralMicrosNowWindows() i64 {\n            return @divFloor(std.os.windows.ntdll.RtlGetSystemTimePrecise() - 116444736000000000, 10);\n        }\n        \"\"\"\n\n:= zig_micros_linux_global () : () =\n    global \"\"\"\n        fn spiralMicrosNowLinux() i64 {\n          var ts: std.os.linux.timespec = undefined;\n          _ = std.os.linux.clock_gettime(.REALTIME, &ts);\n          return @as(i64, ts.sec) * 1000000 + @divFloor(@as(i64, ts.nsec), 1000);\n        }\n        \"\"\"\n\n:= zig_micros_now_global () : () =\n    global \"\"\"\n        fn spiralMicrosNow() i64 {\n            if (@import(\"builtin\").os.tag == .windows) return spiralMicrosNowWindows();\n            return spiralMicrosNowLinux();\n        }\n        \"\"\"\n\n:= zig_micros_now () : i64 =\n    zig_micros_windows_global ()\n    zig_micros_linux_global ()\n    zig_micros_now_global ()\n    $'spiralMicrosNow()' : i64\n\n:= floor_div (a : i64) (b : i64) : i64 =\n    := q = a / b\n    ? a % b <> 0 && (a < 0) <> (b < 0) ?> q - 1 |: q\n\n:= civil_era (days : i64) : i64 * i64 =\n    := z = days + 719468\n    := era = floor_div z 146097\n    era, z - era * 146097\n\n:= civil_year_of_era (day_of_era : i64) : i64 =\n    (day_of_era - day_of_era / 1460 + day_of_era / 36524 - day_of_era / 146096) / 365\n\n:= civil_day_of_year (day_of_era : i64) (year_of_era : i64) : i64 =\n    day_of_era - (365 * year_of_era + year_of_era / 4 - year_of_era / 100)\n\n:= civil_month (month_from_march : i64) : i64 = ? month_from_march < 10 ?> month_from_march + 3 |: month_from_march - 9\n\n:= civil_month_day (day_of_era : i64) (year_of_era : i64) : i64 * i64 =\n    := day_of_year = civil_day_of_year day_of_era year_of_era\n    := month_from_march = (5 * day_of_year + 2) / 153\n    civil_month month_from_march, day_of_year - (153 * month_from_march + 2) / 5 + 1\n\n:= civil_of_days (days : i64) : i64 * i64 * i64 =\n    := era, day_of_era = civil_era days\n    := year_of_era = civil_year_of_era day_of_era\n    := month, day = civil_month_day day_of_era year_of_era\n    year_of_era + era * 400 + (? month <= 2 ?> 1 |: 0), month, day\n\n:= clock_of_day (of_day : i64) : i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 =\n    := seconds = of_day / 1000000\n    seconds / 3600, seconds % 3600 / 60, seconds % 60, of_day % 1000000\n\n:= civil_of_micros (micros : i64) : i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 =\n    := micros_per_day = 86400000000i64\n    := days = floor_div micros micros_per_day\n    := year, month, day = civil_of_days days\n    := hour, minute, second, fraction = clock_of_day (micros - days * micros_per_day)\n    year, month, day, hour, minute, second, fraction\n\n:= pad_digits (width : i32) (n : i64) : string = n |> sm'::obj_to_string |> sm'::pad_left width '0'\n\n:~ ^ zig_run_end (pattern : string) (c : char) (j : i32) : i32 =\n    ? j < sm'::length pattern && sm'::index j pattern = c ?> zig_run_end pattern c (j + 1) |: j\n\n:== zig_run = { pattern : string; c : char; i : i32; stop : i32; width : i32 }\n\n:= zig_fraction_or_literal (r : zig_run) (micros : i64) : string =\n    ? r::c = 'f'\n    ?> pad_digits 7i32 (micros * 10) |> sm'::slice 0i32 (r::width - 1)\n    |: sm'::slice r::i (r::stop - 1) r::pattern\n\n:= zig_time_piece (r : zig_run) (fields : i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64) : string =\n    := _, _, _, hour, minute, second, micros = fields\n    ? r::c = 'H' ?> pad_digits r::width hour\n    |? r::c = 'm' ?> pad_digits r::width minute\n    |? r::c = 's' ?> pad_digits r::width second\n    |: zig_fraction_or_literal r micros\n\n:= zig_piece (r : zig_run) (fields : i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64) : string =\n    := year, month, day, _, _, _, _ = fields\n    ? r::c = 'y' ?> pad_digits r::width year\n    |? r::c = 'M' ?> pad_digits r::width month\n    |? r::c = 'd' ?> pad_digits r::width day\n    |: zig_time_piece r fields\n\n:~ ^ zig_format_from (pattern : string) (i : i32) (fields : i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64) : string =\n    ? i >= sm'::length pattern ?> \"\"\n    |:\n        := c = sm'::index i pattern\n        := stop = zig_run_end pattern c i\n        zig_piece { pattern c i stop width = stop - i } fields ++# zig_format_from pattern stop fields\n\n:= zig_year (date_time : date_time) : i32 =\n    date_time |> zig_micros_of |> civil_of_micros |> \\ (year, _, _, _, _, _, _) => conv year : i32\n\n:= get_year (date_time : date_time) : i32 =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => $'0' : i32\n        Lua = \\ () => $'0' : i32\n        Fsharp = \\ () => date_time |> $'_.Year' : i32\n        Python = \\ () => $'!date_time.year' : i32\n        Rust = \\ () => $'chrono::Datelike::year(&!date_time)' : i32\n        Zig = \\ () => zig_year date_time\n    }\n\n:= split_date_time (date_time : date_time) : date_gleam * time_of_day_gleam * duration_gleam =\n    $'!date_time.0', $'!date_time.1', $'!date_time.2'\n\n:= tempo_added (result : timestamp_gleam) (duration : duration_gleam) : tempo_date_time =\n    global \"import tempo/datetime\"\n    := tempo_date_time : tempo_date_time = result |> $'datetime.from_timestamp'\n    $'!tempo_date_time |> datetime.add(!duration)' : tempo_date_time\n\n:= new_timestamp_gleam\n    (date, time_of_day, duration : date_gleam * time_of_day_gleam * duration_gleam)\n    : timestamp_gleam\n    =\n    global \"import gleam/time/timestamp\"\n    := result : timestamp_gleam = $'timestamp.from_calendar(!date, !time_of_day, !duration)'\n    tempo_added result duration |> $'datetime.to_timestamp'\n\n:= tempo_of (date_time : date_time) : tempo_date_time =\n    global \"import tempo/datetime\"\n    date_time |> split_date_time |> new_timestamp_gleam |> $'datetime.from_timestamp'\n\n:= format_gleam (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := tempo_date_time = tempo_of date_time\n    := pattern = ? format = \"\" ?> \"M-D-YY hh:mm:ss A\" |: format\n    $'!tempo_date_time |> datetime.format(tempo.Custom(!pattern))' : string\n\n:= lua_date_text (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := date_format = ? get_year date_time < 1000 ?> \"%m-%d-%y\" |: \"%m-%d-%Y\"\n    := dated : optionm'::option' string = $'os.date(!date_format, !date_time)'\n    := padded = dated |> optionm'::default_value' \"\"\n    $'(!padded):gsub(\"0(%d)\", \"%1\")' : string\n\n:= lua_time_text (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := timed : optionm'::option' string = $'os.date(\"%I:%M:%S %p\", !date_time)'\n    timed |> optionm'::default_value' \"\"\n\n:= format_lua (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := date_time = ~~ date_time\n    ? format <> \"\"\n    ?> $'os.date(!format, !date_time)' : string\n    |: lua_date_text date_time ++# \" \" ++# lua_time_text date_time\n\n:= format_fsharp (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := pattern = ? format = \"\" ?> \"M-d-y hh:mm:ss tt\" |: format\n    $'!date_time.ToString' pattern : string\n\n:= python_full_year_text (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    $'\\'{dt.month}-{dt.day}-{dt.year} {dt:%I}:{dt:%M}:{dt:%S} {dt:%p}\\'.format(dt=!date_time)' : string\n\n:= python_short_year_text (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    $'\\'{dt.month}-{dt.day}-{dt:%y} {dt:%I}:{dt:%M}:{dt:%S} {dt:%p}\\'.format(dt=!date_time)' : string\n\n:= python_default_text (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    ? get_year date_time < 1000 ?> python_full_year_text date_time |: python_short_year_text date_time\n\n:= format_python (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := date_time = ~~ date_time\n    ? format <> \"\" ?> $'!date_time.strftime(!format)' : string |: python_default_text date_time\n\n:= format_rust (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := pattern = ? format = \"\" ?> \"%-m-%-d-%-y %I:%M:%S %p\" |: format\n    $'Rc::<str>::from(!date_time.format(&*!pattern).to_string())' : string\n\n:= format_zig (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := pattern = ? format = \"\" ?> \"MM-dd-yyyy HH:mm:ss\" |: format\n    date_time |> zig_micros_of |> civil_of_micros |> zig_format_from pattern 0i32\n\n:= format (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => format_gleam format date_time\n        Lua = \\ () => format_lua format date_time\n        Fsharp = \\ () => format_fsharp format date_time\n        Python = \\ () => format_python format date_time\n        Rust = \\ () => format_rust format date_time\n        Zig = \\ () => format_zig format date_time\n    }\n\n:= format_iso8601 (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => date_time |> format \"YYYY-MM-DDTHH-mm-ss.SSS\" : string\n        Lua = \\ () => date_time |> format \"%Y-%m-%dT%H-%M-%S.%f\" : string\n        Fsharp = \\ () => date_time |> format \"yyyy-MM-ddTHH-mm-ss.fff\" : string\n        Python = \\ () => date_time |> format \"%Y-%m-%dT%H-%M-%S.%f\" : string\n        Rust = \\ () => date_time |> format \"%Y-%m-%dT%H-%M-%S.%3f\" : string\n        Zig = \\ () => date_time |> format \"yyyy-MM-ddTHH-mm-ss.fff\" : string\n    }\n\n:! naive_date_rust = $'chrono::NaiveDate'\n\n:= rust_naive_date (year : i32) (month : u32) (day : u32) : naive_date_rust =\n    $'chrono::NaiveDate::from_ymd_opt(!year, !month, !day).unwrap()' : naive_date_rust\n\n:= rust_date_at (date : naive_date_rust) (hour : u32) (minute : u32) (second : u32) : date_time =\n    $'!date.and_hms_opt(!hour, !minute, !second).unwrap()' : date_time\n\n:= rust_date_at_milli (date : naive_date_rust) (hour : u32) (minute : u32) (second : u32) (milli : u32) : date_time =\n    $'!date.and_hms_milli_opt(!hour, !minute, !second, !milli).unwrap()' : date_time\n\n:= rust_date_at_nano (date : naive_date_rust) (hour : u32) (minute : u32) (second : u32) (nano : u32) : date_time =\n    $'!date.and_hms_nano_opt(!hour, !minute, !second, !nano).unwrap()' : date_time\n\n:= gleam_date_time (date : date_gleam) (time_of_day : time_of_day_gleam) (duration : duration_gleam) : date_time =\n    (date, time_of_day, duration) |> convert::to\n\n:= min_value_gleam () : date_time =\n    := date = $'calendar.Date(1, calendar.January, 1)' : date_gleam\n    := time_of_day = $'calendar.TimeOfDay(0, 0, 0, 0)' : time_of_day_gleam\n    gleam_date_time date time_of_day ($'duration.seconds(0) ' : duration_gleam)\n\n:= min_value_lua () : date_time =\n    := stamp : optionm'::option' date_time = $'os.time{year=1, month=1, day=1, hour=0, min=0, sec=0}'\n    stamp |> optionm'::default_value' ($'-62135596800' : date_time)\n\n:= min_value_python () : date_time =\n    global \"import datetime\"\n    $'datetime.datetime.min' : date_time\n\n:= min_value () : date_time =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => min_value_gleam ()\n        Lua = \\ () => min_value_lua ()\n        Fsharp = \\ () => $'System.DateTime.MinValue' : date_time\n        Python = \\ () => min_value_python ()\n        Rust = \\ () => rust_date_at (rust_naive_date 1i32 1u32 1u32) 0u32 0u32 0u32\n        Zig = \\ () => -62135596800000000i64 |> zig_date_time_of\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ":| day_of_week =\n    | Sunday\n    | Monday\n    | Tuesday\n    | Wednesday\n    | Thursday\n    | Friday\n    | Saturday\n\n:| month =\n    | January\n    | February\n    | March\n    | April\n    | May\n    | June\n    | July\n    | August\n    | September\n    | October\n    | November\n    | December\n\n:! day = int\n\n:! year = int\n\n:! date_gleam =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () =>\n                global \"import gleam/time/calendar\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'calendar.Date'\n    )\n:! time_of_day_gleam =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () =>\n                global \"import gleam/time/calendar\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'calendar.TimeOfDay'\n    )\n:! duration_gleam =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () =>\n                global \"import gleam/time/duration\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'duration.Duration'\n    )\n\n:! date_time_python =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Python = (\\ () => global \"import datetime\") : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'datetime.datetime'\n    )\n:== date_time_switch =\n    {\n        Gleam : date_gleam * time_of_day_gleam * duration_gleam\n        Lua : i64\n        Fsharp : $'System.DateTime'\n        Python : date_time_python\n        Rust : $'chrono::NaiveDateTime'\n        TypeScript : $'Date'\n        Zig : i64\n    }\n:! date_time = $'backend_switch `(date_time_switch)'\n\n:! calendar_month =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () =>\n                global \"import gleam/time/calendar\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'calendar.Month'\n    )\n\n:! tempo_date_time =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Gleam = (\\ () =>\n                global \"import tempo\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'tempo.DateTime'\n    )\n\n:= zig_micros_of (date_time : date_time) : i64 = $'!date_time' : i64\n\n:= zig_date_time_of (micros : i64) : date_time = $'!micros' : date_time\n\n:= zig_micros_windows_global () : () =\n    global \"\"\"\n        fn spiralMicrosNowWindows() i64 {\n            return @divFloor(std.os.windows.ntdll.RtlGetSystemTimePrecise() - 116444736000000000, 10);\n        }\n        \"\"\"\n\n:= zig_micros_linux_global () : () =\n    global \"\"\"\n        fn spiralMicrosNowLinux() i64 {\n          var ts: std.os.linux.timespec = undefined;\n          _ = std.os.linux.clock_gettime(.REALTIME, &ts);\n          return @as(i64, ts.sec) * 1000000 + @divFloor(@as(i64, ts.nsec), 1000);\n        }\n        \"\"\"\n\n:= zig_micros_now_global () : () =\n    global \"\"\"\n        fn spiralMicrosNow() i64 {\n            if (@import(\"builtin\").os.tag == .windows) return spiralMicrosNowWindows();\n            return spiralMicrosNowLinux();\n        }\n        \"\"\"\n\n:= zig_micros_now () : i64 =\n    zig_micros_windows_global ()\n    zig_micros_linux_global ()\n    zig_micros_now_global ()\n    $'spiralMicrosNow()' : i64\n\n:= floor_div (a : i64) (b : i64) : i64 =\n    := q = a / b\n    ? a % b <> 0 && (a < 0) <> (b < 0) ?> q - 1 |: q\n\n:= civil_era (days : i64) : i64 * i64 =\n    := z = days + 719468\n    := era = floor_div z 146097\n    era, z - era * 146097\n\n:= civil_year_of_era (day_of_era : i64) : i64 =\n    (day_of_era - day_of_era / 1460 + day_of_era / 36524 - day_of_era / 146096) / 365\n\n:= civil_day_of_year (day_of_era : i64) (year_of_era : i64) : i64 =\n    day_of_era - (365 * year_of_era + year_of_era / 4 - year_of_era / 100)\n\n:= civil_month (month_from_march : i64) : i64 = ? month_from_march < 10 ?> month_from_march + 3 |: month_from_march - 9\n\n:= civil_month_day (day_of_era : i64) (year_of_era : i64) : i64 * i64 =\n    := day_of_year = civil_day_of_year day_of_era year_of_era\n    := month_from_march = (5 * day_of_year + 2) / 153\n    civil_month month_from_march, day_of_year - (153 * month_from_march + 2) / 5 + 1\n\n:= civil_of_days (days : i64) : i64 * i64 * i64 =\n    := era, day_of_era = civil_era days\n    := year_of_era = civil_year_of_era day_of_era\n    := month, day = civil_month_day day_of_era year_of_era\n    year_of_era + era * 400 + (? month <= 2 ?> 1 |: 0), month, day\n\n:= clock_of_day (of_day : i64) : i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 =\n    := seconds = of_day / 1000000\n    seconds / 3600, seconds % 3600 / 60, seconds % 60, of_day % 1000000\n\n:= civil_of_micros (micros : i64) : i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 =\n    := micros_per_day = 86400000000i64\n    := days = floor_div micros micros_per_day\n    := year, month, day = civil_of_days days\n    := hour, minute, second, fraction = clock_of_day (micros - days * micros_per_day)\n    year, month, day, hour, minute, second, fraction\n\n:= pad_digits (width : i32) (n : i64) : string = n |> sm'::obj_to_string |> sm'::pad_left width '0'\n\n:~ ^ zig_run_end (pattern : string) (c : char) (j : i32) : i32 =\n    ? j < sm'::length pattern && sm'::index j pattern = c ?> zig_run_end pattern c (j + 1) |: j\n\n:== zig_run = { pattern : string; c : char; i : i32; stop : i32; width : i32 }\n\n:= zig_fraction_or_literal (r : zig_run) (micros : i64) : string =\n    ? r::c = 'f'\n    ?> pad_digits 7i32 (micros * 10) |> sm'::slice 0i32 (r::width - 1)\n    |: sm'::slice r::i (r::stop - 1) r::pattern\n\n:= zig_time_piece (r : zig_run) (fields : i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64) : string =\n    := _, _, _, hour, minute, second, micros = fields\n    ? r::c = 'H' ?> pad_digits r::width hour\n    |? r::c = 'm' ?> pad_digits r::width minute\n    |? r::c = 's' ?> pad_digits r::width second\n    |: zig_fraction_or_literal r micros\n\n:= zig_piece (r : zig_run) (fields : i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64) : string =\n    := year, month, day, _, _, _, _ = fields\n    ? r::c = 'y' ?> pad_digits r::width year\n    |? r::c = 'M' ?> pad_digits r::width month\n    |? r::c = 'd' ?> pad_digits r::width day\n    |: zig_time_piece r fields\n\n:~ ^ zig_format_from (pattern : string) (i : i32) (fields : i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64 * i64) : string =\n    ? i >= sm'::length pattern ?> \"\"\n    |:\n        := c = sm'::index i pattern\n        := stop = zig_run_end pattern c i\n        zig_piece { pattern c i stop width = stop - i } fields ++# zig_format_from pattern stop fields\n\n:= zig_year (date_time : date_time) : i32 =\n    date_time |> zig_micros_of |> civil_of_micros |> \\ (year, _, _, _, _, _, _) => conv year : i32\n\n:= get_year (date_time : date_time) : i32 =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => $'0' : i32\n        Lua = \\ () => $'0' : i32\n        Fsharp = \\ () => date_time |> $'_.Year' : i32\n        Python = \\ () => $'!date_time.year' : i32\n        Rust = \\ () => $'chrono::Datelike::year(&!date_time)' : i32\n        Zig = \\ () => zig_year date_time\n    }\n\n:= split_date_time (date_time : date_time) : date_gleam * time_of_day_gleam * duration_gleam =\n    $'!date_time.0', $'!date_time.1', $'!date_time.2'\n\n:= tempo_added (result : timestamp_gleam) (duration : duration_gleam) : tempo_date_time =\n    global \"import tempo/datetime\"\n    := tempo_date_time : tempo_date_time = result |> $'datetime.from_timestamp'\n    $'!tempo_date_time |> datetime.add(!duration)' : tempo_date_time\n\n:= new_timestamp_gleam\n    (date, time_of_day, duration : date_gleam * time_of_day_gleam * duration_gleam)\n    : timestamp_gleam\n    =\n    global \"import gleam/time/timestamp\"\n    := result : timestamp_gleam = $'timestamp.from_calendar(!date, !time_of_day, !duration)'\n    tempo_added result duration |> $'datetime.to_timestamp'\n\n:= tempo_of (date_time : date_time) : tempo_date_time =\n    global \"import tempo/datetime\"\n    date_time |> split_date_time |> new_timestamp_gleam |> $'datetime.from_timestamp'\n\n:= format_gleam (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := tempo_date_time = tempo_of date_time\n    := pattern = ? format = \"\" ?> \"M-D-YY hh:mm:ss A\" |: format\n    $'!tempo_date_time |> datetime.format(tempo.Custom(!pattern))' : string\n\n:= lua_date_text (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := date_format = ? get_year date_time < 1000 ?> \"%m-%d-%y\" |: \"%m-%d-%Y\"\n    := dated : optionm'::option' string = $'os.date(!date_format, !date_time)'\n    := padded = dated |> optionm'::default_value' \"\"\n    $'(!padded):gsub(\"0(%d)\", \"%1\")' : string\n\n:= lua_time_text (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := timed : optionm'::option' string = $'os.date(\"%I:%M:%S %p\", !date_time)'\n    timed |> optionm'::default_value' \"\"\n\n:= format_lua (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := date_time = ~~ date_time\n    ? format <> \"\"\n    ?> $'os.date(!format, !date_time)' : string\n    |: lua_date_text date_time ++# \" \" ++# lua_time_text date_time\n\n:= format_fsharp (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := pattern = ? format = \"\" ?> \"M-d-y hh:mm:ss tt\" |: format\n    $'!date_time.ToString' pattern : string\n\n:= python_full_year_text (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    $'\\'{dt.month}-{dt.day}-{dt.year} {dt:%I}:{dt:%M}:{dt:%S} {dt:%p}\\'.format(dt=!date_time)' : string\n\n:= python_short_year_text (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    $'\\'{dt.month}-{dt.day}-{dt:%y} {dt:%I}:{dt:%M}:{dt:%S} {dt:%p}\\'.format(dt=!date_time)' : string\n\n:= python_default_text (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    ? get_year date_time < 1000 ?> python_full_year_text date_time |: python_short_year_text date_time\n\n:= format_python (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := date_time = ~~ date_time\n    ? format <> \"\" ?> $'!date_time.strftime(!format)' : string |: python_default_text date_time\n\n:= format_rust (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := pattern = ? format = \"\" ?> \"%-m-%-d-%-y %I:%M:%S %p\" |: format\n    $'Rc::<str>::from(!date_time.format(&*!pattern).to_string())' : string\n\n:= format_zig (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    := pattern = ? format = \"\" ?> \"MM-dd-yyyy HH:mm:ss\" |: format\n    date_time |> zig_micros_of |> civil_of_micros |> zig_format_from pattern 0i32\n\n:= format (format : string) (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => format_gleam format date_time\n        Lua = \\ () => format_lua format date_time\n        Fsharp = \\ () => format_fsharp format date_time\n        Python = \\ () => format_python format date_time\n        Rust = \\ () => format_rust format date_time\n        Zig = \\ () => format_zig format date_time\n    }\n\n:= format_iso8601 (date_time : date_time) : string =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => date_time |> format \"YYYY-MM-DDTHH-mm-ss.SSS\" : string\n        Lua = \\ () => date_time |> format \"%Y-%m-%dT%H-%M-%S.%f\" : string\n        Fsharp = \\ () => date_time |> format \"yyyy-MM-ddTHH-mm-ss.fff\" : string\n        Python = \\ () => date_time |> format \"%Y-%m-%dT%H-%M-%S.%f\" : string\n        Rust = \\ () => date_time |> format \"%Y-%m-%dT%H-%M-%S.%3f\" : string\n        Zig = \\ () => date_time |> format \"yyyy-MM-ddTHH-mm-ss.fff\" : string\n    }\n\n:! naive_date_rust = $'chrono::NaiveDate'\n\n:= rust_naive_date (year : i32) (month : u32) (day : u32) : naive_date_rust =\n    $'chrono::NaiveDate::from_ymd_opt(!year, !month, !day).unwrap()' : naive_date_rust\n\n:= rust_date_at (date : naive_date_rust) (hour : u32) (minute : u32) (second : u32) : date_time =\n    $'!date.and_hms_opt(!hour, !minute, !second).unwrap()' : date_time\n\n:= rust_date_at_milli (date : naive_date_rust) (hour : u32) (minute : u32) (second : u32) (milli : u32) : date_time =\n    $'!date.and_hms_milli_opt(!hour, !minute, !second, !milli).unwrap()' : date_time\n\n:= rust_date_at_nano (date : naive_date_rust) (hour : u32) (minute : u32) (second : u32) (nano : u32) : date_time =\n    $'!date.and_hms_nano_opt(!hour, !minute, !second, !nano).unwrap()' : date_time\n\n:= gleam_date_time (date : date_gleam) (time_of_day : time_of_day_gleam) (duration : duration_gleam) : date_time =\n    (date, time_of_day, duration) |> convert::to\n\n:= min_value_gleam () : date_time =\n    := date = $'calendar.Date(1, calendar.January, 1)' : date_gleam\n    := time_of_day = $'calendar.TimeOfDay(0, 0, 0, 0)' : time_of_day_gleam\n    gleam_date_time date time_of_day ($'duration.seconds(0) ' : duration_gleam)\n\n:= min_value_lua () : date_time =\n    := stamp : optionm'::option' date_time = $'os.time{year=1, month=1, day=1, hour=0, min=0, sec=0}'\n    stamp |> optionm'::default_value' ($'-62135596800' : date_time)\n\n:= min_value_python () : date_time =\n    global \"import datetime\"\n    $'datetime.datetime.min' : date_time\n\n:= min_value () : date_time =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => min_value_gleam ()\n        Lua = \\ () => min_value_lua ()\n        Fsharp = \\ () => $'System.DateTime.MinValue' : date_time\n        Python = \\ () => min_value_python ()\n        Rust = \\ () => rust_date_at (rust_naive_date 1i32 1u32 1u32) 0u32 0u32 0u32\n        Zig = \\ () => -62135596800000000i64 |> zig_date_time_of\n    }",
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### min_value (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n\nmin_value ()\n|> format \"\"\n|> _assert_eq \"1-1-1 12:00:00 AM\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> fsharp
  ///> cuda

  min_value ()
  |> format ""
  |> _assert_eq "1-1-1 12:00:00 AM"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
