#### minutes (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> gleam\n///> lua\n///> cuda\n///> rust -d chrono\n///> typescript\n\n~~ date_time_milliseconds 2002 2 2 20 22 24 26\n|> new_time_span (date_time_milliseconds 2001 1 1 10 11 12 13)\n|> minutes\n|> _assert_eq 11","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> gleam
  ///> lua
  ///> cuda
  ///> rust -d chrono
  ///> typescript

  ~~ date_time_milliseconds 2002 2 2 20 22 24 26
  |> new_time_span (date_time_milliseconds 2001 1 1 10 11 12 13)
  |> minutes
  |> _assert_eq 11
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

