<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= civil_year_and_era (year : i64) (month : i64) : i64 * i64 =\n    := y = ? month <= 2 ?> year - 1 |: year\n    := era = floor_div y 400\n    era, y - era * 400\n\n:= civil_day_of_year_from (month : i64) (day : i64) : i64 =\n    := month_from_march = ? month > 2 ?> month - 3 |: month + 9\n    (153 * month_from_march + 2) / 5 + day - 1\n\n:= days_from_civil (year : i64) (month : i64) (day : i64) : i64 =\n    := era, year_of_era = civil_year_and_era year month\n    := day_of_era = year_of_era * 365 + year_of_era / 4 - year_of_era / 100 + civil_day_of_year_from month day\n    era * 146097 + day_of_era - 719468","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := civil_year_and_era (year : i64) (month : i64) : i64 * i64 =
      := y = ? month <= 2 ?> year - 1 |: year
      := era = floor_div y 400
      era, y - era * 400

  := civil_day_of_year_from (month : i64) (day : i64) : i64 =
      := month_from_march = ? month > 2 ?> month - 3 |: month + 9
      (153 * month_from_march + 2) / 5 + day - 1

  := days_from_civil (year : i64) (month : i64) (day : i64) : i64 =
      := era, year_of_era = civil_year_and_era year month
      := day_of_era = year_of_era * 365 + year_of_era / 4 - year_of_era / 100 + civil_day_of_year_from month day
      era * 146097 + day_of_era - 719468
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

