#### timestamp_from_guid (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n///> zig\n///> cuda\n///> gleam\n///> lua\n\ntimestamp_from_guid (guid::new_guid \"00000000-0000-0000-00dc-ba9876543210\")\n|> \\ (timestamp micros) => micros\n|> _assert_eq 0i64","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> rust
  ///> zig
  ///> cuda
  ///> gleam
  ///> lua

  timestamp_from_guid (guid::new_guid "00000000-0000-0000-00dc-ba9876543210")
  |> \ (timestamp micros) => micros
  |> _assert_eq 0i64
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

