#### new_guid_from_timestamp (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust -d chrono\n\nutc_now ()\n|> to_timestamp\n|> new_guid_from_timestamp\n|> timestamp_from_guid\n|> \\ (timestamp t) =>\n    (convert::convert t - (utc_now () |> to_timestamp |> \\ (timestamp x) => convert::convert x)) / 100000i64\n|> _assert_eq 0i64","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
